---
import Layout from '../layouts/Layout.astro';
import '../styles/ai-mortgage-admin/styles.css';
import '../styles/ai-mortgage-admin/sections.css';
import '../styles/ai-mortgage-admin/motion.css';
---

<Layout
  title="Theo Insurance Admin — More renewals retained. Less time lost to admin."
  description="Drop in the policy. Theo Insurance Admin reads the file, drafts the renewal quote and chases the client for whatever's missing."
  ogTitle="Theo Insurance Admin — More renewals retained. Less time lost to admin."
  ogDescription="Drop in the policy. Theo Insurance Admin reads the file, drafts the renewal quote and chases the client for whatever's missing."
  includeHomeStyles={false}
>

<style is:global>
  /* Theo accent — slate. Trust / reliability palette. */
  :root {
    --lime: #475569;
    --lime-2: #334155;
    --lime-ink: #FFFFFF;
    --lime-rgb: 71, 85, 105;
  }
</style>

<div class="scroll-progress"></div>
<a class="float-cta" href="#book"><span class="dot"></span>Book a call<span class="arrow">→</span></a>

<header class="wrap">
  <nav class="nav">
    <a class="nav-brand" href="#">
      <img src="/images/the-claws-logo.svg" alt="TheClaws" class="nav-brand-logo" />
      <span>Theo Insurance Admin</span>
    </a>
    <div class="nav-links">
      <a href="#problem">Problem</a>
      <a href="#how">How it works</a>
      <a href="#case">Case study</a>
      <a href="#incl">Included</a>
      <a href="#faq">FAQ</a>
    </div>
    <a class="btn btn-sm btn-primary" href="#book">Book a call <span class="arrow">→</span></a>
  </nav>
</header>

<section class="hero wrap">
  <div class="hero-left">
    <div class="eyebrow reveal"><span class="dot"></span>Renewals reviewed in minutes, not hours</div>
    <h1 class="reveal reveal-delay-1">More renewals retained.<br><span class="mark">Less time lost to admin.</span></h1>
    <p class="sub reveal reveal-delay-2">Drop in the policy. Theo Insurance Admin reads the file, drafts the renewal quote and chases the client for whatever's missing.</p>
    <div class="btns reveal reveal-delay-3">
      <a class="btn btn-lime btn-magnet" href="#book">Book a call &amp; see it on your renewals <span class="arrow">→</span></a>
      <a class="btn btn-ghost" href="#how">See how it works</a>
    </div>
    <p class="micro reveal reveal-delay-4">We'll review one live renewal on the call and show what it would have prepped — bring the policy, no prep needed.</p>

    <hr class="hero-divider reveal reveal-delay-4">

    <div class="hero-caps reveal reveal-delay-5">
      <div class="hero-cap">
        <span class="ic">
          <svg width="14" height="14" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2.4" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"><path d="M14 2H6a2 2 0 0 0-2 2v16a2 2 0 0 0 2 2h12a2 2 0 0 0 2-2V8z"></path><polyline points="14 2 14 8 20 8"></polyline><line x1="8" y1="13" x2="16" y2="13"></line><line x1="8" y1="17" x2="16" y2="17"></line></svg>
        </span>
        <strong>Reads the whole policy</strong>
        <span>Schedule, NCB, claims history, occupation, address, mid-term changes.</span>
      </div>
      <div class="hero-cap">
        <span class="ic">
          <svg width="14" height="14" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2.4" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"><path d="M21 15a2 2 0 0 1-2 2H7l-4 4V5a2 2 0 0 1 2-2h14a2 2 0 0 1 2 2z"></path></svg>
        </span>
        <strong>Drafts the chase</strong>
        <span>Written from the actual file. You review before sending.</span>
      </div>
      <div class="hero-cap">
        <span class="ic">
          <svg width="14" height="14" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2.4" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"><path d="M12 22s8-4 8-10V5l-8-3-8 3v7c0 6 8 10 8 10z"></path></svg>
        </span>
        <strong>Fits your firm's process</strong>
        <span>Your panel, your IDD wording, your fair-value statement, your tone.</span>
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>

  <div class="hero-stage">
    <img class="agent" src="/images/account-manager.webp" alt="Theo Insurance Admin reviewing a renewal">
    <div class="sbubble"><span class="spark"></span> What needs attention on policy #INS-2847?</div>

    <div class="fcard fcard-alert">
      <div class="fc-head">
        <span class="ic">!</span>
        <span>Missing items flagged</span>
        <span class="pill">4</span>
      </div>
      <div class="chip-list">
        <div class="chip-item"><svg class="chip-ic" width="11" height="13" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"><path d="M14 2H6a2 2 0 0 0-2 2v16a2 2 0 0 0 2 2h12a2 2 0 0 0 2-2V8z"/><polyline points="14 2 14 8 20 8"/></svg><span><b>NCB proof</b> · 7 years</span></div>
        <div class="chip-item"><svg class="chip-ic" width="11" height="13" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"><path d="M14 2H6a2 2 0 0 0-2 2v16a2 2 0 0 0 2 2h12a2 2 0 0 0 2-2V8z"/><polyline points="14 2 14 8 20 8"/></svg><span><b>Vehicle photos</b> · current</span></div>
        <div class="chip-item"><svg class="chip-ic" width="11" height="13" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"><path d="M14 2H6a2 2 0 0 0-2 2v16a2 2 0 0 0 2 2h12a2 2 0 0 0 2-2V8z"/><polyline points="14 2 14 8 20 8"/></svg><span><b>Claims history</b> · 5 yr declaration</span></div>
        <div class="chip-item"><svg class="chip-ic" width="11" height="13" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"><path d="M14 2H6a2 2 0 0 0-2 2v16a2 2 0 0 0 2 2h12a2 2 0 0 0 2-2V8z"/><polyline points="14 2 14 8 20 8"/></svg><span><b>Occupation</b> · update needed</span></div>
      </div>
    </div>

    <div class="fcard fcard-todo">
      <div class="fc-head">
        <span class="ic">✓</span>
        <span>Todo List</span>
        <span class="pill lime">2 ITEMS</span>
      </div>
      <div class="todo-i">
        <div class="ti-head">📊 Renewal quote<span class="ti-pill">Drafted</span></div>
        <div class="ti-sub">3 underwriter quotes, fair-value note attached</div>
      </div>
      <div class="todo-i">
        <div class="ti-head">📞 Claim follow-up<span class="ti-pill out">Reviewed</span></div>
        <div class="ti-sub">Loss adjuster doc pack ready, awaiting client sign</div>
      </div>
    </div>

    <div class="fcard fcard-wa">
      <div class="fc-head">
        <span class="ic ic-wa" aria-label="WhatsApp">
          <svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="currentColor" width="12" height="12" aria-hidden="true"><path d="M17.472 14.382c-.297-.149-1.758-.867-2.03-.967-.273-.099-.471-.148-.67.15-.197.297-.767.966-.94 1.164-.173.199-.347.223-.644.075-.297-.15-1.255-.463-2.39-1.475-.883-.788-1.48-1.761-1.653-2.059-.173-.297-.018-.458.13-.606.134-.133.298-.347.446-.52.149-.174.198-.298.297-.497.1-.198.05-.371-.025-.52-.075-.149-.669-1.612-.916-2.207-.242-.579-.487-.5-.669-.51-.173-.008-.371-.01-.57-.01-.198 0-.52.074-.792.372-.272.297-1.04 1.016-1.04 2.479 0 1.462 1.065 2.875 1.213 3.074.149.198 2.096 3.2 5.077 4.487.709.306 1.262.489 1.694.625.712.227 1.36.195 1.871.118.571-.085 1.758-.719 2.006-1.413.248-.694.248-1.289.173-1.413-.074-.124-.272-.198-.57-.347m-5.421 7.403h-.004a9.87 9.87 0 01-5.031-1.378l-.361-.214-3.741.982.998-3.648-.235-.374a9.86 9.86 0 01-1.51-5.26c.001-5.45 4.436-9.884 9.888-9.884 2.64 0 5.122 1.03 6.988 2.898a9.825 9.825 0 012.893 6.994c-.003 5.45-4.437 9.884-9.885 9.884m8.413-18.297A11.815 11.815 0 0012.05 0C5.495 0 .16 5.335.157 11.892c0 2.096.547 4.142 1.588 5.945L.057 24l6.305-1.654a11.882 11.882 0 005.683 1.448h.005c6.554 0 11.89-5.335 11.893-11.893a11.821 11.821 0 00-3.48-8.413z"/></svg>
        </span>
        <span>WhatsApp chase</span>
        <span class="pill">Draft</span>
      </div>
      <div class="wa-msg">Hi Mr Khan, your renewal is in 21 days. To hold your no-claims discount and get the best price could you confirm your current occupation, send a quick photo of the vehicle, and confirm any incidents in the last 5 years (even non-fault)?</div>
      <div class="wa-meta">
        <span>To: Mr Khan</span>
        <span class="send">Review &amp; send →</span>
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>

<div class="ticker-band">
  <div class="ticker">
    <span class="t-strong">What would you do with 50 extra retained renewals a year?</span>
    <span class="t-sep">·</span>
    <span>Because that's what the renewal admin is costing you.</span>
    <span class="t-sep">·</span>
    <span class="t-strong">Future brokers don't pay it anymore</span>
    <span class="t-sep">—</span>
    <span>they place what their AI already prepared.</span>
    <span class="t-sep">·</span>
    <span class="t-strong">What would you do with 50 extra retained renewals a year?</span>
    <span class="t-sep">·</span>
    <span>Because that's what the renewal admin is costing you.</span>
    <span class="t-sep">·</span>
    <span class="t-strong">Future brokers don't pay it anymore</span>
    <span class="t-sep">—</span>
    <span>they place what their AI already prepared.</span>
    <span class="t-sep">·</span>
  </div>
</div>

<section id="problem" class="real bg-grid bg-grid-dark">
  <div class="wrap real-grid">
    <div class="reveal">
      <div class="sec-label">The problem</div>
      <h2>Your underwriter relationships are not the bottleneck. <em>Renewal admin</em> is.</h2>
      <p>You already know your panel and how to place a risk. What slows you down is everything around it: chasing NCB proof, refreshing claims declarations, getting occupation updates, prepping mid-term changes, packaging risks for underwriters, and explaining premium walks before clients walk.</p>
      <div class="problem-cards">
        <div class="pcard">
          <span class="pcard-k">01 / Renewals</span>
          <h4>Late prep</h4>
          <p>Prep starts 5 days out. Clients shop the day they get the invite.</p>
        </div>
        <div class="pcard pcard-dark">
          <span class="pcard-k">02 / Compliance</span>
          <h4>IDD &amp; fair value</h4>
          <p>Demands &amp; needs, fair-value statement, suitability rationale.</p>
        </div>
        <div class="pcard">
          <span class="pcard-k">03 / Claims</span>
          <h4>Doc chase</h4>
          <p>Loss adjuster forms, photos, repair estimates, sign-offs.</p>
        </div>
        <div class="pcard pcard-lime">
          <span class="pcard-k">04 / Client work</span>
          <h4>Client chase</h4>
          <p>Draft WhatsApps, renewal calls, premium-walk conversations.</p>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>

    <div class="real-col">
      <div class="transcript reveal reveal-delay-2">
        <div class="sec-label">The real problem</div>

        <div class="transcript-stage">
          <img class="transcript-photo" src="/images/the-real-problem.png" alt="An exhausted insurance broker at the end of a long day" />

          <div class="stage-overlay">
            <div class="stage-quote-wrap">
              <blockquote class="stage-quote">
                I lose renewals because <span class="hl">I don't get to them in time.</span> By the time I call, they've already shopped.
              </blockquote>
              <div class="sig stage-sig">— Broker using Theo Insurance Admin</div>
            </div>

            <div class="notes-wall" aria-hidden="true">
              <div class="note note-1">
                <span class="note-tape"></span>
                <p>"60 renewals due this month. Got to 40 of them before the invites went out."</p>
                <span class="note-attr">— Broker, Birmingham</span>
              </div>
              <div class="note note-2 note-lime">
                <span class="note-tape"></span>
                <p>"Lost a £4K commercial renewal because the occupation change wasn't picked up. Premium walked 30%."</p>
                <span class="note-attr">— Account manager, Bristol</span>
              </div>
              <div class="note note-3">
                <span class="note-tape"></span>
                <p>"Claims chase at 9pm. Loss adjuster wanted photos by Monday. Forgot to ask the client."</p>
                <span class="note-attr">— Director, Manchester</span>
              </div>
            </div>
          </div>
        </div>

        <div class="body-txt">
          The admin around each policy sets the cap. <strong>More clients means more renewals to prep</strong>, more declarations to refresh, more claims to chase, more underwriter packs to assemble. So the broker either stops growing the book, or grows it and loses retention to slow renewals.
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>

<section class="fixes">
  <div class="wrap">
    <div class="fixes-head reveal">
      <div class="sec-label fixes-eyebrow">
        <svg class="sl-ic" width="14" height="14" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" aria-hidden="true"><path d="M10.29 3.86 1.82 18a2 2 0 0 0 1.71 3h16.94a2 2 0 0 0 1.71-3L13.71 3.86a2 2 0 0 0-3.42 0Z"/><line x1="12" y1="9" x2="12" y2="13"/><line x1="12" y1="17" x2="12.01" y2="17"/></svg>
        Why the usual fixes do not work
      </div>
      <h2>Hiring an account handler takes months. Templates <em>do not read the file</em>. Generic AI does not know an MTA from a NCD step-back.</h2>
    </div>

    <div class="fix-row reveal reveal-delay-2">
      <div class="fix-card fc-fail">
        <span class="fc-badge fc-x" aria-hidden="true">
          <svg width="11" height="11" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2.6" stroke-linecap="round"><line x1="18" y1="6" x2="6" y2="18"/><line x1="6" y1="6" x2="18" y2="18"/></svg>
        </span>
        <span class="fc-ic" aria-hidden="true">
          <svg width="15" height="15" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.8" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"><path d="M20 21v-2a4 4 0 0 0-4-4H8a4 4 0 0 0-4 4v2"/><circle cx="12" cy="7" r="4"/></svg>
        </span>
        <h4>An account handler</h4>
        <p>Costs a full salary before they help. Needs training on your panel, your wordings, your fair-value process and your tone. Still leaves the broker doing the calls.</p>
      </div>
      <div class="fix-card fc-fail">
        <span class="fc-badge fc-x" aria-hidden="true">
          <svg width="11" height="11" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2.6" stroke-linecap="round"><line x1="18" y1="6" x2="6" y2="18"/><line x1="6" y1="6" x2="18" y2="18"/></svg>
        </span>
        <span class="fc-ic" aria-hidden="true">
          <svg width="15" height="15" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.8" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"><path d="M14 2H6a2 2 0 0 0-2 2v16a2 2 0 0 0 2 2h12a2 2 0 0 0 2-2V8z"/><polyline points="14 2 14 8 20 8"/></svg>
        </span>
        <h4>Quote portal templates</h4>
        <p>Generic "your renewal is due" emails. They do not refresh the file, do not catch occupation changes, and clients open the email and shop the price elsewhere.</p>
      </div>
      <div class="fix-card fc-fail">
        <span class="fc-badge fc-x" aria-hidden="true">
          <svg width="11" height="11" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2.6" stroke-linecap="round"><line x1="18" y1="6" x2="6" y2="18"/><line x1="6" y1="6" x2="18" y2="18"/></svg>
        </span>
        <span class="fc-ic" aria-hidden="true">
          <svg width="15" height="15" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.8" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"><path d="M21 15a2 2 0 0 1-2 2H7l-4 4V5a2 2 0 0 1 2-2h14a2 2 0 0 1 2 2z"/></svg>
        </span>
        <h4>Generic AI chatbots</h4>
        <p>Wait for you to explain the policy from scratch every time. They do not understand NCD step-backs, MTA pricing, business interruption sums insured or why a flood claim three years ago still walks the price.</p>
      </div>
    </div>

    <div class="fits-box reveal reveal-delay-3">
      <span class="fits-pill">
        <svg width="12" height="12" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="3" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" aria-hidden="true"><polyline points="20 6 9 17 4 12"/></svg>
        How it fits
      </span>
      <div class="fits-body">
        <h3>A reading and drafting layer. You stay the broker on the file.</h3>
        <div class="fits-body-copy">
          <p>Every renewal pack, every WhatsApp, every chase is reviewed by you before anything moves. Theo Insurance Admin does not bind cover, sign off claims, or commit price.</p>
        </div>
      </div>

      <div class="fix-row fix-row-win">
        <div class="fix-card fc-win">
          <span class="fc-badge fc-check" aria-hidden="true">
            <svg width="11" height="11" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="3" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"><polyline points="20 6 9 17 4 12"/></svg>
          </span>
          <span class="fc-ic" aria-hidden="true">
            <svg width="15" height="15" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.8" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"><rect x="3" y="3" width="18" height="18" rx="2"/><polyline points="9 12 11 14 15 10"/></svg>
          </span>
          <h4>You decide what gets placed</h4>
          <p>It drafts, packages, and asks. It does not bind cover or commit price.</p>
        </div>
        <div class="fix-card fc-win">
          <span class="fc-badge fc-check" aria-hidden="true">
            <svg width="11" height="11" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="3" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"><polyline points="20 6 9 17 4 12"/></svg>
          </span>
          <span class="fc-ic" aria-hidden="true">
            <svg width="15" height="15" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.8" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"><path d="M12 22s8-4 8-10V5l-8-3-8 3v7c0 6 8 10 8 10z"/></svg>
          </span>
          <h4>Built for UK insurance</h4>
          <p>Motor, home, commercial, fleet, professional indemnity. NCB, MTA, IDD, demands &amp; needs. Not generic admin.</p>
        </div>
        <div class="fix-card fc-win">
          <span class="fc-badge fc-check" aria-hidden="true">
            <svg width="11" height="11" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="3" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"><polyline points="20 6 9 17 4 12"/></svg>
          </span>
          <span class="fc-ic" aria-hidden="true">
            <svg width="15" height="15" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.8" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"><path d="M14 2H6a2 2 0 0 0-2 2v16a2 2 0 0 0 2 2h12a2 2 0 0 0 2-2V8z"/><polyline points="14 2 14 8 20 8"/><line x1="9" y1="13" x2="15" y2="13"/><line x1="9" y1="17" x2="13" y2="17"/></svg>
          </span>
          <h4>Fits your firm's process</h4>
          <p>Your panel, your IDD wording, your fair-value statement, your consumer-duty phrasing. Configured at setup.</p>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>

<section id="how" class="how bg-grid">
  <div class="wrap">
    <div class="sec-label reveal">How it works</div>
    <h2 class="reveal reveal-delay-1">Four steps from renewal-due to <em>retained &amp; placed.</em></h2>

    <div class="how-flow">
      <div class="hstep reveal reveal-delay-2">
        <span class="hs-eyebrow">Step one</span>
        <h3>Drop in the policy</h3>
        <div class="hs-visual">
          <div class="doc-mock">
            <span class="doc-line w70"></span>
            <span class="doc-line w50"></span>
            <span class="doc-line w65"></span>
            <span class="doc-block"></span>
          </div>
        </div>
        <p>Schedule, claims history, mid-term endorsements, NCB, occupation, address, sums insured.</p>
        <span class="hs-tag">Drop the policy</span>
      </div>

      <div class="hs-arrow" aria-hidden="true">
        <svg width="14" height="14" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"><line x1="5" y1="12" x2="19" y2="12"/><polyline points="12 5 19 12 12 19"/></svg>
      </div>

      <div class="hstep reveal reveal-delay-3">
        <span class="hs-eyebrow">Step two</span>
        <h3>Theo Insurance Admin reviews</h3>
        <div class="hs-visual">
          <div class="review-mock">
            <div class="rm-card-back"></div>
            <div class="rm-card">
              <span class="rm-head"></span>
              <span class="rm-line w60"></span>
              <span class="rm-line w45"></span>
              <span class="rm-reply" aria-hidden="true">
                <svg width="10" height="10" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2.4" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"><polyline points="15 10 20 15 15 20"/><path d="M4 4v7a4 4 0 0 0 4 4h12"/></svg>
              </span>
            </div>
          </div>
        </div>
        <p>Refreshes the file, flags changes, drafts the underwriter pack and the client chase.</p>
        <span class="hs-tag">Full review</span>
      </div>

      <div class="hs-arrow" aria-hidden="true">
        <svg width="14" height="14" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"><line x1="5" y1="12" x2="19" y2="12"/><polyline points="12 5 19 12 12 19"/></svg>
      </div>

      <div class="hstep reveal reveal-delay-4">
        <span class="hs-eyebrow">Step three</span>
        <h3>You get drafts &amp; flags</h3>
        <div class="hs-visual">
          <div class="chips-mock">
            <span class="cm-chip cm-1">Quote pack</span>
            <span class="cm-chip cm-2">Occupation change</span>
            <span class="cm-chip cm-3">NCB chase</span>
          </div>
        </div>
        <p>Review the underwriter pack, approve the WhatsApp chase, decide what goes to the client.</p>
        <span class="hs-tag">Tap, send, done</span>
      </div>

      <div class="hs-arrow" aria-hidden="true">
        <svg width="14" height="14" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"><line x1="5" y1="12" x2="19" y2="12"/><polyline points="12 5 19 12 12 19"/></svg>
      </div>

